---
description: Atlas OS product philosophy and scope discipline
alwaysApply: true
---

Atlas OS is a private personal intelligence operating system. Owner → Atlas → capabilities → results.

Phase 1 proves a real intelligence loop: authenticated shell, streaming Atlas conversation, persistent memory, project/business context, and a command home that only shows real data.

Never fake memories, operatives, metrics, or integrations. If a capability does not exist, omit it or mark it unavailable.

Do not build Founder Command, Operatives workforce, health, creator studio, voice calls, or a public marketing site unless the current task explicitly expands Phase 1.

Atlas is one intelligence with many capabilities, not multiple chatbot personas. Challenge weak ideas. Do not be agreeable theater.
